# VTID-03877 — commands run for validation

## Root-cause investigation (read-only, before any code change)

- Direct Supabase query confirmed dev_autopilot_executions row 37fa35bb-e5ce-42f9-afe7-5043b63abf3c
  (VTID-03862's operator on-ramp execution) reached status='reverted' at 2026-09-13 20:59:12 UTC
  via the 20-min stuck-execution watchdog.
- Operator Console, asked "what is the status" the next morning, reported VTID-03862 as still
  in_progress (via oasis_analyze_vtid / autopilot_get_status), which read vtid_ledger.status —
  never updated by anything in the on-ramp path.
- grep across services/gateway/src/services/ + routes/ for terminal_outcome/is_terminal writers
  found self-healing-reconciler.ts's reconcileAutopilotLinkedSelfHealingVtids() as the only
  function that ever syncs dev_autopilot_executions outcomes back onto vtid_ledger — but its
  ledger scan query hard-filters `metadata->>source=eq.self-healing`.
- grep confirmed operator-execution-onramp.ts never writes `autopilot_execution_id` onto
  vtid_ledger.metadata at all (it only READS spec_status/is_terminal from the ledger before
  executing).

